    {
      "number": 94,
      "text": "## Часть B. REST API",
      "page": 2,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 95,
      "text": "",
      "page": 2,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 96,
      "text": "Дочерний документ части A: «Уведомление о расходах по карте — REST API».",
      "page": 2,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 97,
      "text": "",
      "page": 2,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 98,
      "text": "### Общие параметры",
      "page": 2,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 99,
      "text": "",
      "page": 2,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 100,
      "text": "| Поле | Значение |",
      "page": 2,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 101,
      "text": "| :--- | :--- |",
      "page": 2,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 102,
      "text": "| **Description** | Сохранение порога. Функциональные требования: чтение порога |",
      "page": 2,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 103,
      "text": "| **REST type** | GET |",
      "page": 2,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 104,
      "text": "| **Authorization** | Bearer, сессия владельца карты |",
      "page": 2,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 105,
      "text": "| **Controller** | AlertsController |",
      "page": 2,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 106,
      "text": "| **URL type** | Dev / Prod |",
      "page": 2,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 107,
      "text": "| **Request URL** | Dev: `/alerts/saveLimit` . Prod: — |",
      "page": 2,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 108,
      "text": "| **CURL** | `curl -G \"$BASE/alerts/saveLimit\" -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" --data 'cardId=demo-42&amount=50000&enabled=1'` |",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 109,
      "text": "| **Swagger** | — |",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 110,
      "text": "| **Gitlab project** | Учебный контур |",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 111,
      "text": "| **Framework** | Учебный контур |",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 112,
      "text": "| **Author** | Школа тестирования |",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 113,
      "text": "| **Developer** | Команда практикума |",
