    },
    {
      "number": 114,
      "text": "",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 115,
      "text": "### Логика работы метода",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 116,
      "text": "1. Проверить пользовательскую сессию.",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 117,
      "text": "2. Проверить принадлежность карты клиенту.",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 118,
      "text": "3. Проверить сумму и переключатель.",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 119,
      "text": "4. Заменить настройку и вернуть результат сохранения.",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 120,
      "text": "5. При отклонении суммы вернуть прежнее состояние и результат ERROR.",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 121,
      "text": "",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 122,
      "text": "### Особые правила",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 123,
      "text": "1. Целое число тенге, обе границы включены.",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 124,
      "text": "2. Повторное сохранение заменяет действующую настройку.",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 125,
      "text": "3. Изменение порога сохраняет накопленные расходы.",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 126,
      "text": "",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 127,
      "text": "### Схема",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 128,
      "text": "```text",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 129,
      "text": "Приложение → AlertsController → хранилище настроек → AlertsController → приложение.",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 130,
      "text": "```",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 131,
      "text": "",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 132,
      "text": "### Параметры запроса",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 133,
      "text": "",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 134,
      "text": "#### Path-параметры",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 135,
      "text": "Не используются.",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 136,
      "text": "",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 137,
      "text": "#### Query-параметры",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 138,
      "text": "",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 139,
      "text": "| Parameter | Format | Size | Mandatory | Logic | Description | DB field |",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 140,
      "text": "| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 141,
      "text": "| `cardId` | string | 1–64 | Да | Карта клиента | Идентификатор карты | `card_id` |",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 142,
      "text": "| `amount` | integer | 32 bit | Да | 1 000–1 000 000 | Порог в тенге | `limit_kzt` |",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 143,
      "text": "| `enabled` | integer | 1 знак | Да | 0 или 1 | Признак включения | `enabled` |",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 144,
      "text": "",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 145,
      "text": "#### Request body",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 146,
      "text": "* **Content-Type:** `application/json` .",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 147,
      "text": "* Тело не используется.",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 148,
      "text": "",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 149,
      "text": "### Ответ",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 150,
      "text": "Если результат 200 или 201 — успешный. Если результат 400, 401 и далее — неуспешный.",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 151,
      "text": "",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 152,
      "text": "| Parameter | Format | Logic | Description | DB field |",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 153,
      "text": "| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 154,
      "text": "| `result` | string | OK / ERROR | Исход сохранения | — |",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 155,
      "text": "| `amount` | string | При успехе | Порог в тенге | `limit_kzt` |",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 156,
      "text": "| `enabled` | string | «0» или «1» | Признак включения | `enabled` |",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 157,
      "text": "| `message` | string | При ошибке | Описание ошибки | — |",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 158,
      "text": "",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 159,
      "text": "### Статусы",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 160,
      "text": "",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 161,
      "text": "**200.** Ответ в случае успешного выполнения метода.",
      "page": 3,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 162,
      "text": "**400.** Ответ в случае, если параметры запроса заполнены неверно.",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 163,
      "text": "",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 164,
      "text": "#### 200. Successful — Created",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 165,
      "text": "```json",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 166,
      "text": "{\"result\":\"OK\",\"amount\":\"50000\",\"enabled\":\"1\"}",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 167,
      "text": "```",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 168,
      "text": "или",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 169,
      "text": "```json",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 170,
      "text": "{\"result\":\"ERROR\",\"message\":\"Проверьте сумму\"}",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 171,
      "text": "```",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 172,
      "text": "",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 173,
      "text": "**401.** Ответ в случае, если запрос выполнен без необходимой авторизации.",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 174,
      "text": "**403.** Ответ в случае, если на указанный ресурс доступ запрещен.",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 175,
      "text": "**500.** Ответ в случае, если произошла внутренняя ошибка сервера.",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 176,
      "text": "",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 177,
      "text": "#### 400. Unsuccessful — Bad request",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 178,
      "text": "```json",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 179,
      "text": "{\"message\":\"Некорректный запрос\"}",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 180,
      "text": "```",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 181,
      "text": "",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 182,
      "text": "#### 401. Unsuccessful — Unauthorized",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 183,
      "text": "```json",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 184,
      "text": "{\"message\":\"Требуется вход\"}",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 185,
      "text": "```",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 186,
      "text": "",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 187,
      "text": "#### 403. Unsuccessful — Forbidden",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 188,
      "text": "Для чужой карты возвращается 404, как и для отсутствующей карты.",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 189,
      "text": "**404**",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 190,
      "text": "```json",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 191,
      "text": "{\"message\":\"Карта не найдена\"}",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 192,
      "text": "```",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 193,
      "text": "",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 194,
      "text": "#### 500. Unsuccessful — Internal server error",
      "page": 4,
      "heading_level": null,
      "table_row": false
    },
    {
      "number": 195,
